{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10122090","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10122090","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1012209001:0":{"text":"전… 마음의 준비가 됐어요… 안 좋은 소식이라도 말해 주세요.","source_cn":"我……我做好准备了……即便是糟糕的消息，也请告诉我吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB414CCDFB7BBEE37","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1012209001":{"text":"전… 마음의 준비가 됐어요… 안 좋은 소식이라도 말해 주세요.","source_cn":"我……我做好准备了……即便是糟糕的消息，也请告诉我吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB414CCDFB7BBEE37","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1012209002:0":{"text":"이건 그의 잎사귀군요… 심장에서 자라는 예쁜 잎이었죠.","source_cn":"这是他的叶子……最漂亮的那一片，长在心口的那一片。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A483FBE02AA0109","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1012209003:0":{"text":"흑… 흐흑…","source_cn":"呜……呜呜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81B36D0C03060708","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1012209004:0":{"text":"미안해요… 친구를 구하지 못했어요.","source_cn":"抱歉……我们没能救下你的朋友。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94092AE3C1305F62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1012209005:0":{"text":"아니에요… 사과하지 말아 주세요! 여러분 잘못도 아닌걸요.","source_cn":"不……还请不要道歉！并不是你们的责任！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5AB5B6F124F9B68","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1012209006:0":{"text":"고마워요… 이 잎사귀를 가져다 줘서.","source_cn":"谢谢你们……谢谢你们带回了这片叶子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE4DD9627166BC40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1012209007:0":{"text":"허니리프베어가 죽은 동료를 묻어줄 거예요. 전… <style=\"highlight\">이 잎사귀를 묻어주고 싶어요</style>.","source_cn":"叶角熊会埋葬去世的同伴，我想……<style=high...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD4D3672362AD9EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1012209008:0":{"text":"그래요, 저희가 같이 갈게요.","source_cn":"好，我们会陪你一起的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC18322CE778F2D3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:0:1":{"text":"(허니리프베어의 잎사귀를 건넨다)","source_cn":"（交出叶角熊的叶子）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x82CC4E146D1BE04B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"(허니리프베어의 잎사귀를 건넨다)","female":"(허니리프베어의 잎사귀를 건넨다)","variant_male_record_index":"61016","variant_female_record_index":"61017","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"